{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_9000_situation", "source_sha256": "04eee66fd7450a58340c0b9b939a3e14e294bc188172cbe70fa167ef5a546f34", "ja": "グラビアのお仕事　撮影後", "zh": "写真工作　拍摄后", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_9000_place", "source_sha256": "9da5ea1e5639ad2d1d415e43df10c0664928ed4ff4fcc90c5509c62b7467dfe9", "ja": "夜の繁華街", "zh": "夜间繁华街", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_9001_p", "source_sha256": "7c3c0e013b5fa31944880383f8b7cc605fa45da32a7624557539167957668cd6", "ja": "（アイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』のグラビア撮影が終了。\nやよいは『路地裏キッズ』を上手く演じてくれた）", "zh": "（偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》的写真拍摄结束了。\n弥生出色地演绎了《小巷孩子》。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_9002_005yay", "source_sha256": "72da9c6e319127e2e31e188352c85d136a4179c4136b73d626b289ba0e027b58", "ja": "一人がいいって言ってるけど、本当は仲良くなる方法が\nわからないだけで、お友達が欲しい女の子……。", "zh": "明明说一个人就好，其实只是因为不知道该怎么和别人成为朋友，是个想交朋友的女孩子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_9003_005yay", "source_sha256": "beb0e3a4047d5c55fb524fea4a37e687cb251e69e08e79b59cdb55b351086d46", "ja": "本当にそんな子がいたら、\n私、すぐにお友達になりに行きますー！", "zh": "如果真的有那样的孩子，\n我马上就去和她交朋友！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_9004_005yay", "source_sha256": "4a7918ba37e73cb23cf9713ae371b3c5d0308507d5803c0e1afa6254bf255a21", "ja": "でも、まずその子がそうだって気づかなくちゃダメです\nよね？　どうやって気づいたらいいんでしょうか……。", "zh": "可是，首先得意识到那孩子就是那样才行，对吧？要怎么才能察觉到呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_9005_p", "source_sha256": "0824d0df239d6b9f0636f1dbf50c77c3d0123f8868f111c46f099dd02a236e4d", "ja": "確かに、最初にして最大の難関だな。\n難しいところだけど……。", "zh": "确实，这是最初也是最大的难关。\n虽然很难说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_9006", "source_sha256": "dbab7b8de3a88dfda506c7928cc48d936aa5827ce6c0c3c0dda2b0b2a7a8be47", "ja": "少しずつ話そう", "zh": "慢慢聊吧", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_9007", "source_sha256": "f730f35fb16db353c7bb107b425071ef436e672c7a3f1352f8ca068b3269b910", "ja": "ストレートに", "zh": "直截了当地", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_9200_p", "source_sha256": "fa5c910865202a052494f59f7023ce0bfd4083b7e61d94c6c5d58fdaec8b46f1", "ja": "少しずつ話して仲良くなるしかないんじゃないかな。\nお互いを理解していけば、自然とわかるはずだ。", "zh": "也只能通过多聊聊天，一点点拉近彼此的距离了吧。\n只要能渐渐理解对方，自然就会明白的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_9201_005yay", "source_sha256": "ca8da3afb9fbdecaa9f05415f0c7fa616fadf8d14f10afcf2ef4fbe4f9feef80", "ja": "私もそれがいいと思いますー！　いきなりじゃなくて、\n少しずつお話して、少しずつ仲良くなって……。", "zh": "我也觉得这样比较好！不要一下子就……先一点一点地聊天，再一点一点地成为好朋友……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_9202_005yay", "source_sha256": "d5eaa1441735a26d635bd87c2c967d307c02fcf52232cc6a0806a6e8323734cb", "ja": "最後は、ずっと一緒にいられるお友達になるんです！\nゆっくりでも、ちゃんと仲良くなるのが一番ですよね♪", "zh": "最后，就能成为永远在一起的好朋友了！慢慢来也没关系，好好地增进感情才是最重要的嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_9300_p", "source_sha256": "fa5c910865202a052494f59f7023ce0bfd4083b7e61d94c6c5d58fdaec8b46f1", "ja": "少しずつ話して仲良くなるしかないんじゃないかな。\nお互いを理解していけば、自然とわかるはずだ。", "zh": "也只能通过多聊聊天，一点点拉近彼此的距离了吧。\n只要能渐渐理解对方，自然就会明白的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_9301_005yay", "source_sha256": "e49ef10556de73b71b54db918351bf399f6022cfa5259335d97cd10662679447", "ja": "やっぱり、それが一番ですよね！　でも、わかってる\nんですけど……気になることもあって。", "zh": "果然，那样才是最好的呢！不过，虽然我也明白……\n但还是有些放不下心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_9302_005yay", "source_sha256": "c9cba50170a98c805181a3f02f1981c06a53afc489e848724c931e35049eb762", "ja": "すぐに気づいてあげられないことには変わりないので、\nさびしい気持ちにさせちゃわないか、心配かもです～。", "zh": "毕竟没能马上察觉到这一点，还是不会改变，所以我有点担心，会不会让对方感到寂寞～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_9500_p", "source_sha256": "5c25f64ed8fe683a0e3e9b38fc9c8df642514222832feed3126341079bf99093", "ja": "友達になりたいって、ストレートに伝えてみるのは\nどうだろう。相手にやよいの気持ちもすぐ伝わるだろ？", "zh": "直接告诉对方你想和她做朋友，\n这样如何？对方也能立刻明白弥生你的心意吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_9501_005yay", "source_sha256": "f1042de4bc7fdf3888c8af7ff5c1dccdccdf9db305c3f51ad064dcce3dd0ff19", "ja": "そうですよね！　最初は「どうして？」って言われちゃ\nうかもしれませんけど、気持ちはしっかり伝えないと！", "zh": "是啊！一开始可能会被问“为什么？”，但不把自己的心意好好传达出去可不行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_9502_005yay", "source_sha256": "14468a98595d7271ba0dfb593ab54b494895f61e9aa195d644e1678402a3a491", "ja": "何度も伝えていたら、その子にも私がすーっごくお友達\nになりたいんだって、わかってもらえるかもですよね！", "zh": "如果反复表达的话，说不定也能让那孩子明白，我真的非常想和她成为朋友呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_9600_p", "source_sha256": "5c25f64ed8fe683a0e3e9b38fc9c8df642514222832feed3126341079bf99093", "ja": "友達になりたいって、ストレートに伝えてみるのは\nどうだろう。相手にやよいの気持ちもすぐ伝わるだろ？", "zh": "直接告诉对方你想和她做朋友，\n这样如何？对方也能立刻明白弥生你的心意吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_9601_005yay", "source_sha256": "12f893d216b0a54a8cf778ea1ac8f39999db664d5ad711089fda41f70f4d24c0", "ja": "それは、そうだと思うんですけど……。最初に驚かせ\nちゃったら、お話してもらえなくなる気がするんです。", "zh": "我也觉得是这样……可是，要是一开始就吓到对方，我感觉对方就不会再和我说话了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_9602_005yay", "source_sha256": "6cd6af4bee82332241b2ecfe7fcca9b0c62de9bb4e7821eb41335128bde3c4f4", "ja": "その子が、仲良くなる方法がわからないだけの子だとも\n限らないですし……うーん、難しいですねー……。", "zh": "也不一定那孩子只是因为不知道该怎么和大家搞好关系……嗯——真难办啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
